OL,3,CUK holidaymakers warned of diarrhoea-
OL,4,Ccausing parasite found in food
OL,6,FHolidaymakers have been warned to take
OL,7,Fprecautions after a steep rise in the
OL,8,Fnumber of cases of explosive diarrhoea
OL,9,Fcaused by a parasite found in foods
OL,10,Fsuch as salad.
OL,12,FAccording to the NHS, cyclospora is
OL,13,Fnot found in the UK, but people can
OL,14,Fbecome infected while travelling to
OL,15,Fcountries where the parasite is more
OL,16,Fcommon, including parts of Central and
OL,17,FSouth America, south and south-east
OL,18,FAsia, the Middle East and Africa.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
