OL,3,CUK holidaymakers warned of diarrhoea-
OL,4,Ccausing parasite found in food
OL,6,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)
OL,7,Fsaid 67 cases of cyclosporiasis have
OL,8,Fbeen reported, with most involving
OL,9,Fpeople who stayed at hotels in
OL,10,FMexico's Riviera Maya and Cancun.
OL,12,FThat compares with an annual average
OL,13,Fof 93 cases recorded between 2022 and
OL,14,F2025.
OL,16,FCyclospora outbreaks are commonly
OL,17,Flinked to contaminated food, including
OL,18,Fsalads, soft fruit and fresh herbs.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
