OL,3,CUK holidaymakers warned of diarrhoea-
OL,4,Ccausing parasite found in food
OL,6,FThe infection can cause diarrhoea,
OL,7,Fstomach cramps, bloating, nausea, loss
OL,8,Fof appetite and fever.
OL,10,FMost cases are mild and clear up
OL,11,Fwithin a few days without treatment,
OL,12,Fbut some infections can be severe or
OL,13,Fprolonged and may require antibiotics.
OL,15,FOf the 67 cases, 48 had visited
OL,16,FMexico, including one person who had
OL,17,Falso travelled to the United States.
OL,19,FOne case involved travel to the US
OL,20,Fonly, while another had travelled to
OL,21,FKenya.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
