OL,3,CUK holidaymakers warned of diarrhoea-
OL,4,Ccausing parasite found in food
OL,6,FThe US is experiencing a major
OL,7,Foutbreak of the infection, which has
OL,8,Fspread across 45 states.
OL,10,FIt is estimated that more than 18,000
OL,11,Fpeople may have been infected, with
OL,12,FMichigan recording the highest number
OL,13,Fof cases, according to the US Centers
OL,14,Ffor Disease Control and Prevention
OL,15,F(CDC).
OL,17,FDr Philip Veal, consultant in travel
OL,18,Fhealth at the UKHSA, said: "We have
OL,19,Frecently detected a rise in cyclospora
OL,20,Finfections among travellers returning
OL,21,Ffrom Mexico.
OL,26,@zD@\OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
