FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785444468
OL,3,CUK holidaymakers warned of diarrhoea-
OL,4,Ccausing parasite found in food
OL,6,F"These infections are caused by a
OL,7,Fparasite and can affect the stomach
OL,8,Fand intestines.
OL,10,F"Travellers to Mexico and other areas
OL,11,Fwhere the infection is more common can
OL,12,Freduce their risk by following good
OL,13,Ffood and water hygiene measures,
OL,14,Fincluding drinking bottled water and
OL,15,Feating thoroughly cooked food, even
OL,16,Fwhen staying in high-end all-inclusive
OL,17,Fresorts.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
