OL,3,CUK holidaymakers warned of diarrhoea-
OL,4,Ccausing parasite found in food
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,F"We also advise avoiding certain foods
OL,12,Fsuch as fresh uncooked berries and
OL,13,Fherbs, unpeeled fruit and salad items."
OL,15,FThe UKHSA is liaising with the Abta
OL,16,Ftravel agents' association and Mexican
OL,17,Fpublic health authorities as part of
OL,18,Fits investigation.
OL,26,@sD@AOUuD@gO]
