OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785444468
OL,3,CUK holidaymakers warned of diarrhoea-
OL,4,Ccausing parasite found in food
OL,6,FDr Veal added: "If you develop
OL,7,Fsymptoms after returning from travel,
OL,8,Fsuch as watery diarrhoea, loss of
OL,9,Fappetite, weight loss, stomach cramps
OL,10,For pain, bloating, increased wind,
OL,11,Fnausea, fatigue or other flu-like
OL,12,Fsymptoms, please seek medical
OL,13,Fattention and inform your healthcare
OL,14,Fprofessional of your travel history.
OL,16,F"The TravelHealthPro website has more
OL,17,Finformation on the steps you can take
OL,18,Fto keep yourself and your family well."
OL,26,@nD@POUxD@AOUzD@gO]
